manticsProps.lean-971-    simp [InitStatesUpdated Hinit]\\nprojects/v4.29.1/.lake/packages/strata/Strata/Languages/Core/StatementSemanticsProps.lean-972-    constructor\\nprojects/v4.29.1/.lake/packages/strata/Strata/Languages/Core/StatementSemanticsProps.lean-973-  case update_some σ x v σ₀ xs vs σ₁ Hup Hups ih =>\\nprojects/v4.29.1/.lake/packages/strata/Strata/Languages/Core/StatementSemanticsProps.lean-974-    refine ⟨rfl, ?_, ?_⟩\\nprojects/v4.29.1/.lake/packages/strata/Strata/Languages/Core/StatementSemanticsProps.lean-975-    . apply updatedStatesInit Hlen1\\nprojects/v4.29.1/.lake/packages/strata/Strata/Languages/Core/StatementSemanticsProps.lean-976-      apply UpdateStateNotDefMonotone' ?_ Hup\\nprojects/v4.29.1/.lake/packages/strata/Strata/Languages/Core/StatementSemanticsProps.lean-977-      apply UpdateStatesNotDefMonotone' ?_ Hups\\nprojects/v4.29.1/.lake/packages/strata/Strata/Languages/Core/StatementSemanticsProps.lean-978-      exact InitStatesNotDefined Hinit\\nprojects/v4.29.1/.lake/packages/strata/Strata/Languages/Core/StatementSemanticsProps.lean-979-      exact InitStatesNodup Hinit\\nprojects/v4.29.1/.lake/packages/strata/Strata/Languages/Core/StatementSemanticsProps.lean-980-    . apply UpdateStates.update_some (σ':=updatedStates σ₀ ks' vs')\\nprojects/v4.29.1/.lake/packages/strata/Strata/Languages/Core/StatementSemanticsProps.lean-981-      . simp [UpdateStateUpdated Hup, updatedStates]\\nprojects/v4.29.1/.lake/packages/strata/Strata/Languages/Core/StatementSemanticsProps.lean-982-        rw [← updatedStateComm']\\nprojects/v4.29.1/.lake/packages/strata/Strata/Languages/Core/StatementSemanticsProps.lean-983-        . have Hdef := UpdateStateDefined' Hup\\nprojects/v4.29.1/.lake/packages/strata/Strata/Languages/Core/StatementSemanticsProps.lean-984-          simp [isDefined, Option.isSome] at Hdef\\nprojects/v4.29.1/.lake/packages/strata/Strata/Languages/Core/StatementSemanticsProps.lean-985-          split at Hdef <;> simp_all\\nprojects/v4.2